<div style="background:#f7f6f2;padding:36px 16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#19324d;">
  <div style="max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dce3e0;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;">
    <div style="background:#173451;padding:24px 32px;color:#ffffff;">
      <div style="font-size:24px;font-weight:bold;">Ballyclare Medical</div>
      <div style="font-size:12px;letter-spacing:3px;color:#a9e3d8;margin-top:6px;">MEDICAL CENTRE</div>
    </div>
    <div style="padding:32px;">
      <h1 style="font-size:25px;margin:0 0 18px;color:#173451;">Activate your patient portal</h1>
      <p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;">Your practice has invited you to create a secure patient portal account. Confirm your email and choose a password to activate your login.</p>
      <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;">Select the button below to confirm your email address and go straight to the secure password form.</p>
      <p style="margin:24px 0 28px;"><%= link_to "Confirm email address and set password", @activation_url, style: "display:inline-block;background:#173451;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:24px;font-weight:bold;" %></p>
      <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#607483;">Your practice must separately verify your identity and approve access before you can view medical records.</p>
      <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#607483;">If you were not expecting this invitation, you can safely ignore it.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
